OFFICIAL OPEN-SOURCE BUILD PATH
-------------------------------
Official builds using the GPL edition of PyQt6 and the AGPL edition of
PyMuPDF/MuPDF use the AGPL-3.0-only option for PDF Studio code. Third-party
components remain under their own licences.

The licensing strategy has been selected, but public binary distribution is
not yet approved. The remaining gates concern reproducible dependency locks,
wheel hashes, packaged Windows testing, clean-machine evidence, and final
release approval. See LICENSING_STRATEGY.md, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, and
release/release_policy.json.

Required runtime components include:

  - PyMuPDF / MuPDF  - AGPL-3.0 or commercial terms (Artifex)
  - PyQt6            - GPL-3.0 or commercial terms (Riverbank)
  - Qt 6             - separate Qt licensing applies
  - Pillow           - Pillow/HPND-style licence
  - pytesseract      - Apache-2.0

Separately installed tools may include Tesseract OCR, LibreOffice, Java, and
Microsoft Office. They are not bundled by PDF Studio and carry their own terms.

Feature-specific optional Python packages may include pdf2docx, tabula-py,
openpyxl, pandas, and pywin32. A final distributor must inventory the exact
packages included in the release manifest and preserve their notices.

